  "prefLabel": "Per-A 101.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 101.02 Applicability. These rules shall apply to all matters within the board's jurisdiction as described by RSA 21-I:46, RSA 21-I:52, RSA 21-I:57 and RSA 21-I:58.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Per-A 100) #7377, eff 10-23-00",
